WEBVTT

1
00:00:00.400 --> 00:00:07.361
Hooded eyes, monolids or big round eyes: every eye shape has a lash curl that suits it best!

2
00:00:07.361 --> 00:00:13.541
Let's look at the C, CC, D and L curls. Which one is made for your eyes?

3
00:00:13.541 --> 00:00:17.986
The C curl is soft, like your own lashes after a lash curler.

4
00:00:17.986 --> 00:00:23.935
For big, round eyes a C curl is plenty, without making the eyes look too round.

5
00:00:23.935 --> 00:00:29.684
The CC curl is a little stronger than C, so small eyes look bigger and brighter.

6
00:00:29.684 --> 00:00:34.186
It's the most popular curl: natural, yet clearly defined.

7
00:00:34.186 --> 00:00:38.848
The D curl is strong, so the tips lift right above the eyelid fold.

8
00:00:38.848 --> 00:00:43.565
On hooded eyes, a D curl keeps your lashes from hiding under the skin.

9
00:00:43.565 --> 00:00:47.946
The L curl is straight at the base and only bends upward near the tip.

10
00:00:47.946 --> 00:00:52.900
It suits monolid eyes and lashes that grow straight or point downwards.

11
00:00:52.900 --> 00:01:00.298
In short: C for big eyes, CC for small eyes, D for hooded eyes and L for monolids.

12
00:01:00.298 --> 00:01:05.250
Not sure about your eye shape? Ask Moja Beauty, and we'll pick the right curl for you!

13
00:01:05.250 --> 00:01:11.676
Book Moja Beauty in seconds on VaraaAi: pick a service, pick a time, done!
